d": "76561198229966120", "personaname": "fireondapoopdek", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198229966120/", "num_games_owned": 351, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 18475, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6329, "last_played": 1761202286, "avatar": "712a2dbfae4b4d67ec04b7ed911b637da0bcc4f2"}, "language": "english", "review": "There is literally only one bad thing about this game...and thats the ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ 100 lobster with fire dmg grind\n", "timestamp_created": 1596840285, "timestamp_updated": 1596840285, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73941133", "author": {"steamid": "76561197974397353", "personaname": "Snuggy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Snuggy4real/", "num_games_owned": 309, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 2050, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1219, "last_played": 1754787293, "avatar": "0cce51bd377b03bd62a0df46acfd64b198ce4286"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun creating builds that work with a variety of weapons on the fly. Good rogue-like and gun mechanics. Would benefit from more scrolls, weapons and levels, but who wouldn't? Game is fun as it stands and look forward to what they offer in the future.", "timestamp_created": 1596839605, "timestamp_updated": 1596839605, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 14, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "73940957", "author": {"steamid": "76561198862173226", "personaname": "Faptimus Prime", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/infinteursa/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 720, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 210, "last_played": 1737339792, "avatar": "26bfb7d16aa289af02a3a1ac8d5ee8f32bd3fd74"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a great Borderlands style game! Easily worth at least $20! I am definitely interested to see where the development of this game goes! If you put just a little more time into creating content for the game, this could easily be a $40 game in no time!\n\nI definitely wish there was a way to make certain types of guns drop more consistently though. Like maybe add perks that add the probability of dropping \"heavy\" weapons (i.e. gatling gun, rocket launcher, etc.), There is the possibility that if you also add more characters, they could have passive perks that make certain types of guns drop more frequently. \n\nMost of what this game needs is to add small things that add consistency to the gameplay. There's too many elements of randomness which takes away from making the player feel like they are a part of the world. You could allow the player to start each run with a guarenteed gun of their choice with no perks instead of a guarenteed random gun.", "timestamp_created": 1596839343, "timestamp_updated": 1596839343, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73940013", "author": {"steamid": "76561198184504278", "personaname": "Zackariias", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198184504278/", "num_games_owned": 199, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 1280, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 291, "last_played": 1764412164, "avatar": "5af2cec3c0931bc6f03d7cc0e8e3576ea815978d"}, "language": "english", "review": "very fun \n", "timestamp_created": 1596837944, "timestamp_updated": 1596837944, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73939907", "author": {"steamid": "76561198147894193", "personaname": "doughnut hierarchy", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ZanguSwe/", "num_games_owned": 538, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 618, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 497, "last_played": 1681071248, "avatar": "c86ca387e2d65a89fa980d94126579100f581aa3"}, "language": "english", "review": "While it's still a bit barebones, Gunfire Reborn is another excellent rogue-lite that, with enough time, can become even better. With a nice artstyle, fun weapons and exciting gameplay, it's fun with or without friends. Both playable heroes at the time of this review are fun in their own way with pros and cons, and the progression feels challenging and engaging.", "timestamp_created": 1596837789, "timestamp_updated": 1596837789, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73938700", "author": {"steamid": "76561198353717442", "personaname": "svenne", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bollhav/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 13